# Vivado project-mode .gitignore
# Keep: *.xpr, *.srcs/ (your .v, .xdc, testbenches, .xci IP files), any *.tcl.
# Ignore: everything Vivado regenerates when you open / build the project.

# --- generated project folders (rebuilt on open / build) ---
*.cache/
*.hw/
*.gen/
*.ip_user_files/
*.runs/
*.sim/
.Xil/

# incremental-compile reference checkpoint copied into the sources tree
# (Vivado only warns if it is missing)
*.srcs/utils_1/imports/

# --- logs, journals, crash files ---
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.backup.*
*.debug
webtalk*
hs_err_pid*
vivado_pid*

# --- build outputs (regenerate with Generate Bitstream) ---
*.bit
*.bin
*.dcp
*.ltx
*.rpt
*.wdb
xsim.dir/

# to keep a ready-to-flash bitstream in the repo, put it in release/
!release/
!release/*.bit

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp